  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Sn</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>59</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Sn</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Zn</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Sn</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Sn</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>059</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi>Sn</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Sn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>So, answer is 17.</p>"
